{"availability":"available","full":"andryou/andryou-twitter-cleaner","name":"andryou-twitter-cleaner","description":"A simple, open-source (free), and database-less Twitter cleaner that allows people to quickly delete their Likes and/or Tweets on Twitter.","category":"Developer tools","language":"PHP","stars":8,"forks":3,"created":"2016-03-18T15:25:55Z","updated":"2016-04-06T16:16:31Z","branch":"master","homepage":null,"topics":[],"demo":"https://www.andryou.com/twittercleaner","color":"#302e55","ink":"#dbd2ff","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-04T16:45:00.841Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-04T16:45:00.841Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-04T16:45:00.841Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-03T14:33:37.698Z","stars":8,"forks":3},{"at":"2026-10-04T16:45:00.841Z","stars":8,"forks":3}],"technologies":[],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["A simple, open-source (free), and database-less Twitter cleaner that allows people to quickly delete their Likes and/or Tweets on Twitter.","Lovingly coded in PHP, uses some native JavaScript and a sprinkling of CSS. Uses tmhOAuth to authenticate with Twitter. It's not the prettiest thing I've created, but I can tell you it works quite well.","This is the only open-source alternative to the likes of www.tweetdelete.net, www.tweetdeleter.com, www.tweeteraser.com, www.twitwipe.com, and others that I know of, which is why I'm deciding to make my code open and free. I created this because I didn't feel comfortable authorizing sites (who haven't published their code) to have access to all my Twitter data."],"features":["delete everything you've Liked/Favourited","delete everything you've Tweeted and Retweeted (automatically tries to delete as close to Twitter's limit as it can: 3,200)","some intelligence coded in to play nicely with Twitter's rate limits","uses PHP $SESSION instead of a database when handling user tokens because there is no need to store/log data","code is fully available for scrutiny/review"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/andryou/andryou-twitter-cleaner/blob/master/readme.md","fingerprint":"4202a2d42cf2a4e9cb3818ebd978c10da2c12c741ffb84ca5c5bc4f551e0312b","extractedAt":"2026-10-03T07:02:19.058Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:16.771Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"A simple, open-source (free), and database-less Twitter cleaner that allows people to quickly delete their Likes and/or Tweets on Twitter.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/andryou/andryou-twitter-cleaner/blob/master/readme.md"},"audience":[{"text":"A simple, open-source (free), and database-less Twitter cleaner that allows people to quickly delete their Likes and/or Tweets on Twitter.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/andryou/andryou-twitter-cleaner/blob/master/readme.md"}],"requirements":[],"fingerprint":"4202a2d42cf2a4e9cb3818ebd978c10da2c12c741ffb84ca5c5bc4f551e0312b","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/andryou/andryou-twitter-cleaner/blob/master/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:16.771Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2016-04-06T16:16:31Z","lastDemoCheckedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:16.772Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/andryou/andryou-twitter-cleaner/blob/master/readme.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-03T14:17:16.771Z","hash":"4202a2d42cf2a4e9cb3818ebd978c10da2c12c741ffb84ca5c5bc4f551e0312b","originalBytes":1781,"storedBytes":1781,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["twitter","code","delete","some","uses","andryou","because","cleaner","coded","created","everything","found","free","leave","likes","open-source","php","thanks","their","twitter.","able","access","accordingly.","account","allows","alternative","appreciated","appreciation","as-is","ask","authenticate","authorizing","automatically","available","button","close","comfortable","css.","data","data.","database","database-less","deciding","deletion","didn","donate","donation","due","favourited","features","feel","footer","free.","fully","handling","haven","instead","intelligence","irreversible","javascript","kn